  "title": "Chickpea Vegetarian Meatballs",
  "description": "These vegetarian chickpea meatballs flavored with garlic and parsley make a quick and easy meatless main dish that is tasty and filling.",
  "authors": [
    "Amanda Koss"
  ],
  "date_published": "2019-04-02T03:06:52-04:00",
